# ValueSet.description
#: ValueSet.description
msgid "Proposal: LOINC codes of the clinical test 'Mean cell hemoglobin concentration (MCHC)' (standard tier, specimen Blood), computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-03-21. Parts: LOINC enumeration (2), LOINC Ontology observables without LOINC code (0), and the ECL as an intensional include. ECL: << 521371010000101 |Mean cell hemoglobin concentration (observable entity)| : << 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = << 30766002 |Quantitative value (qualifier value)|"
msgstr ""

